      <h2 id="olmv1-object-ownership_operator-controller" class="group scroll-mt-20">Object ownership for cluster extensions<a href="#olmv1-object-ownership_operator-controller" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
