      <p class="_abstract">As part of Operator Lifecycle Manager (OLM) v1, the operator-controller creates <code>ClusterObjectSet</code> resources when you install or upgrade content with a <code>ClusterExtension</code> object. <code>ClusterObjectSet</code> objects enable safe, phased rollouts of Kubernetes resources. </p>
